          <rdf:li>Bow/Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Bow &amp; Catra &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i'm listing characters by appearance so i can remember who all is in it lmao</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Ensemble Cast</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Horror</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Found Family</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Modern Setting</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Supernatural Elements</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Trans Characters</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>it's finally here folks</rdf:li>
